More (and updated) observations on the release schedule below:

As at 16 December, it's been 1,366 days since the last major release
(3.4.0) and 738 days since the last minor release (3.4.3).

This represents the longest gap between major releases since 3.0.0 was
released in July 1989.  It is the second longest gap between minor
releases (the gap between 3.2.2 and 3.2.3 was 1,095 days).

All major releases since (and excluding) 3.0.0 have happened in the
period Dec-Apr.

Of the last 5 major releases (3.0.0 to 3.4.0 inclusive), three happened
on Thursdays and two on Sundays.

FWIW, I think it's likely we'll see a release in the next few months.
I can't speculate on whether it will be a major or a minor release.
